  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c63f74dfee30be0",
      "translationZh": "几天前我们分享了 DynamicTune 的理念：通过闭式线性代数在消费级硬件上 ~12 分钟内，将较大教师模型的轨迹流直接转移到较小的学生模型。零反向传播，零训练 token，零梯度下降。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1d295f6300113772",
      "translationZh": "为了消除局部偏差，我们将未量化的 FP16 检查点上传到 Hugging Face，TPN Bench（TaoFu Protocol）在数据中心 NVIDIA L4 GPU 上使用官方 lm_eval 0.4.12 框架（协调器运行 ce494664-d077-4ff1-8741-15cedabc434c）独立评估了该模型。特别感谢 TPN Bench 提供的云 GPU 计算资源！",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3f90ed0dc51a47a",
      "translationZh": "以下是完整 ARC-Challenge（1,172 项，零-shot，贪婪温度 0）的独立评估结果：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2fa6d5e31ce7d57f",
      "translationZh": "原始 Qwen3.5-0.8B Base（未量化 BF16）：37.50% acc_norm（34.60% acc）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "088480584bac1f03",
      "translationZh": "3 轮 SFT 蒸馏（Mythos-0.8B，25k Claude 配对，多 GPU DDP）：38.10% acc_norm（35.80% acc）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d7abe536d0827361",
      "translationZh": "SFT + Model Soup 合并：37.00% acc_norm（灾难性遗忘）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "587c8c55ab7de6bd",
      "translationZh": "原始 Qwen3.5-2B Base（2.5 倍更大模型，Q8）：41.10% acc_norm（37.80% acc）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bd51ba37f4994ac4",
      "translationZh": "DynamicTune 0.8B Base（我们的方法，4 锚点闭式手术）：42.15% acc_norm（40.19% acc）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ba7b2a442d49ca86",
      "translationZh": "为什么这完全疯狂：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f1251ae695ec2aa4",
      "translationZh": "一个0.8B模型实际上击败了大2.5倍的2B模型：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fac7038ecde8b292",
      "translationZh": "在LLM扩展中，参数数量本应是王者。一个800M模型本来不应在ARC-Challenge上击败未压缩的2B模型（42.15% 对 41.10%）。通过从4B中提取轨迹动态并将其拉回到学生SwiGLU块中，高阶推理被直接压缩到边缘权重中。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7cc8073fa71efd5d",
      "translationZh": "零反向传播击败了25,000条SFT指令对：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "884c914cdbf166b2",
      "translationZh": "一个最近发布的项目（kmamine/merge-corrected-sft-distillation-Qwen-Mythos-0.8B）在多GPU集群上对Qwen3.5-0.8B进行了3个epoch的训练，使用了25,000条Claude推理对，在过拟合前达到38.10%。DynamicTune在零梯度下降、零损失函数和零训练令牌的情况下达到42.15%。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0fb50fb5e735d1c5",
      "translationZh": "Ironclad 3.23-sigma统计显著性：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2991a13a694ea167",
      "translationZh": "在1,172个问题上，+4.65%的差异伴随标准误差+-1.44%，得到Z-score为3.23sigma（p < 0.001）。这不是提示调优噪声或随机方差。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c00de84e035aca81",
      "translationZh": "在消费硬件上12分钟与数据中心验证：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1b5d497f9fa329fa",
      "translationZh": "权重手术在本地使用 8GB AMD RX 580 显卡，通过层流式处理（以 FP16 格式加载每一层，计算闭式 SVD 增量，并转储到 RAM）在约 12 分钟内完成。但基准测试是 100% 在云端通过 TPN Bench 在数据中心 NVIDIA L4 硬件上进行的。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e94bef2e2353a51",
      "translationZh": "过去尝试为何失败：谱熵屏障",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6fe65fdd9cc34dca",
      "translationZh": "如果你盲目地在学生模型的全部 24 层上应用权重增量，模型就会崩溃（NLL 爆炸增加 +64.78%）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a3ad25a6ad429bf8",
      "translationZh": "当我们扫描全部 24 层，计算表示残差的归一化谱熵 H（范围 0.0 到 1.0）时：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7c750680b75081a7",
      "translationZh": "第 0 层（H = 0.71）：语义基础干净。对轨迹对齐具有高度接受性。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "afb58e597f5a3115",
      "translationZh": "第 1-22 层（H 在 0.90 到 0.96 之间）：混沌的叠加结。在仅有 1024 维的 800M 模型中，多义特征被塞进密集的叠加中。在此强制线性更新会导致灾难性干扰。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3ff5cdd7b0b53b99",
      "translationZh": "第 23 层（H = 0.93）：特征向词汇 logits 解包的预嵌入边界。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0cd6da174ffa88f",
      "translationZh": "通过将手术限制在 4 个稀疏锚定块（第 0、7、15、23 层）并使用阻尼 Levenberg-Marquardt Tikhonov 伪逆 + 自适应谱秩截断，我们在保护脆弱的叠加结的同时施加正确的轨迹速度。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c1c83c155522c652",
      "translationZh": "可重复性 & 权重",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "79ab4893ff598843",
      "translationZh": "一切都是 100% 开源，并且可以立即进行测试：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "43c6617656d5637e",
      "translationZh": "GitHub 仓库：https://github.com/dsadawq3/DynamicTune",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "118b69f08e8866d5",
      "translationZh": "基础模型（Safetensors）：https://huggingface.co/F-Labs/Qwen3.5-0.8B-DynamicTune-Base",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2396c68e3e6859d1",
      "translationZh": "GGUF 检查点（FP16）：https://huggingface.co/F-Labs/Qwen3.5-0.8B-DynamicTune-Base-GGUF（Qwen3.5-0.8B-DynamicTune-Base-F16.gguf，SHA256：d77cf505108271d72f28298f20c2d158e7aeaf50cc22987db05a9a8973e08709）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c3a5f4b1e12cba1b",
      "translationZh": "使用标准 llama.cpp 在本地运行推理：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d9ff656ecd3f5951",
      "translationZh": "特别感谢 TPN Bench（TaoFu 协议）提供独立数据中心 NVIDIA L4 评估资源。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5b4b0885c621af5",
      "translationZh": "克隆仓库，运行自己的基准测试，并自行测试。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
